NULLBOX — FASTHACKS #2: $0 IMPLEMENTATION PLAN
14 Nov 2026 | github.com/michaelpog/nullbox
Target: 16 points; free/open-source tools and Stripe TEST payments only.

STACK: React/Vite/TypeScript frontend, Rust/Axum API, SQLite/SQLx.
Reuse existing cargo tests, Vitest, tracing, tower-http and /api/healthz.

DEPENDENCY-RANKED FEATURES
1. Deploy (+1): Cloudflare Pages Free (web) + Render Free (Rust API).
2. Tests (+2): existing cargo test + pnpm test; Playwright only if needed.
3. CI/CD (+2): GitHub Actions for build/test + automatic deploy.
4. SEO (+1): HTML title/description, robots.txt, sitemap.xml; no package.
5. Observability (+2): existing tracing + healthz; log errors/requests.
6. Login (+2): axum-login + tower-sessions + Argon2; protect worker API.
7. Security (+3): server-side permissions, input validation, cargo-audit,
   secure sessions, rate limits; remove default admin token immediately.
8. Payments (+3): Stripe Checkout TEST mode, Rust reqwest, webhook
   signature verification; no real money.

DEPENDENCIES
App -> deploy + tests -> CI/CD; deploy -> SEO/observability;
login -> authorization; security before payments. Parallelize where possible.

TEAM SPLIT (150 MINUTES)
A: Deploy + tests + CI/CD (5 pts)
B: Login + security (5 pts)
C: Payments + observability + SEO (6 pts)
Run the hackathon HOT checker after EACH completed feature.

ZERO-COST WARNINGS
- Render Free sleeps and loses local SQLite data on restart: demo only,
  NOT durable production. Keep seed data and verify before judging.
- Use hosting-provided subdomains; no paid instances/disks/domains.
- GitHub Actions: public-repo standard runners are free.
- Stripe TEST transactions cost $0; live transactions do not.
- Keep ADMIN_TOKEN/payment keys in backend environment variables.
- Actual checker/judge criteria override these suggestions.

